The issue is that `map_err` returns the error `e` unchanged, so clippy says to use `inspect_err` instead. But `inspect_err` takes `&E`, not `E`, so I can't return it. Actually, `inspect_err` just inspects the error without consuming it - it's for side effects. That's exactly what we want here (the side effect of removing the temp file).

